.TH "DADE" "1" "Aug 26, 2026" "0.0.2" "dade"
.SH NAME
dade \- dade v0.0.2
.SH COMMAND REFERENCE
.sp
Every game is a sub\-group of the top\-level \fBdade\fP command, so each tool is invoked as
\fBdade <game> <subcommand>\fP\&. The full command tree below is generated from the CLI itself.
.sp
The \fI\%Usage\fP and \fI\%Utilities\fP pages cover the \fBdade incoming\fP extractor in more detail.
.SS dade
.sp
Extract and convert assets from a collection of PC and console video games.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
dade [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.UNINDENT
