.SS extract\-main
.sp
Extract or list the contents of an InstallBuilder installer.
.sp
With no MEMBERS, every member is extracted; otherwise only the named members are. Paths are
those shown by \fB\-\-list\fP\&. Encrypted installers prompt for a password when one is not given.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
dade bitrock extract\-main [OPTIONS] ARCHIVE [MEMBERS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-l, \-\-list
List the archive members and exit.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output\-dir <output_dir>
Extract into this directory.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-password <password>
Password for an encrypted installer.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-c, \-\-compression <compression>
Override the auto\-detected page compression for encrypted installers.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Options
zip | lzma | lzham
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be extracted without writing anything.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-q, \-\-quiet
Do not print each member as it is extracted.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable debug level logging.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
