.SS convert\-scene
.sp
Convert SCENE into an interleaved mesh and its textures under OUTDIR.
.sp
Writes \fBmodels/<name>.bin\fP holding [x, y, z, u, v] as 32\-bit floats per triangle vertex,
\fBmodels/<name>.json\fP describing the batches, and one PNG per referenced texture under
\fBtextures/<name>\fP\&. Textures are resolved by checksum against the BMP directories given with
\-\-texture\-dir and converted with ImageMagick; pass \-\-no\-textures to skip that entirely.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
dade cli convert\-scene [OPTIONS] SCENE OUTDIR
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-name <name>
Base name for the mesh files. Defaults to the scene file stem.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-t, \-\-texture\-dir <texture_dirs>
Directory of hash\-named BMP textures to resolve against (repeatable).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-corner\-source <corner_source>
How to derive a face corner count.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Default
\fB\(aqlength\(aq\fP
.TP
.B Options
flag | length
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-triangulation <triangulation>
How to split a quad into triangles.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Default
\fB\(aqfan\(aq\fP
.TP
.B Options
fan | strip
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-scale <scale>
Uniform scale factor recorded in the manifest.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Default
\fB0.00390625\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-textures
Skip texture resolution and conversion.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-convert\-path <convert_path>
Path to the ImageMagick convert binary.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable debug level logging.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B SCENE
Required argument
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B OUTDIR
Required argument
