\fB\(aq8x6\(aq\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-suffix <suffix>
Image format for each texture. Use .ppm to avoid needing ImageMagick.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Default
\fB\(aq.png\(aq\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-montage
Write the textures without contact sheets.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-montage\-path <montage_path>
Path to the ImageMagick montage binary.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-convert\-path <convert_path>
Path to the ImageMagick convert binary.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
