.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-key <key>
Key as hex, for a chart enciphered under neither of the game keys.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-image <image>
Also render the chart as a strip image at this path.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-scale <scale>
