.SS extract\-assets
.sp
Extract the downloadable texture archive ARCHIVE.
.sp
ARCHIVE is one of the three the game fetches: \fBiPad\fP, \fBiPad2x\fP, or \fBiPhone@2x\fP\&. Each is
encrypted with ZipCrypto under a password the executable carries, and holds a little over two
thousand PNG textures under one top\-level directory.
.sp
The archive\(aqs own index, a second encrypted ZIP stored as the \fBlist\fP entry, is written out as
\fBmanifest.json\fP\&. Each texture is examined and only the Apple\-optimised ones go through
\fBpngdefry\fP; the rest are already ordinary PNGs.
.sp
